        "original_id": "ad11d6d4-92e5-50d8-aba4-1ec837c8c06c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marina Prior, Andrew Lloyd Webber, Anthony Warlow, Rob Guest\n- Works: Aspects of Andrew Lloyd Webber, The Phantom of the Opera\n- Organizations: Melbourne Symphony Orchestra\n- Roles: Christine Daaé\n- Places: Australia\n\nFacts:\n- From 1990 to 1993, Marina Prior starred as the original Christine Daaé in the Australian premiere of The Phantom of the Opera.\n- During that run, Marina Prior performed opposite Anthony Warlow and later Rob Guest.\n- Aspects of Andrew Lloyd Webber is the second studio album by Australian singer Marina Prior.\n- Aspects of Andrew Lloyd Webber features the Melbourne Symphony Orchestra.",
